{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8d93ab2d-1463-8ead-adda-1d8d99039adb",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:25:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. Yes, I am calling about the storm drain. The water, it is coming from the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where are you calling about, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One hundred seventy-two Harrison Avenue. The Fort Adams side. [pause] Hello? You hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:19:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, a little choppy. One seventy-two Harrison Avenue, Fort Adams side. Got it. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the storm, the last weekend. The nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. The drain in front of my house, it is full, it do not take the water. Water go up on the street and come to my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the drain out front was backed up during the storm. Did it get into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. In the cellar. A few inches of water, [line breaks up] inside. I live in this house many years. Never before. This is the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me. A few inches in the cellar, and that's the first time in all your years there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:20:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. First time. Many years, never one time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, writing that down. Cellar, a few inches, first time, drain out front. Is the water still coming up now, or has it gone down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:21:06-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now it is less. But the water in the street, it is going to the neighbor. He have a garage, next to me. The water go toward the garage door. I am afraid for him, it is going to go inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so water's running toward the neighbor's garage. That's good to know, I'll put that in so the crew sees it's heading that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:21:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, I want to ask, when they come last? To clean this drain. When somebody came by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at that. Give me a second, I'll see what's on file for Harrison. [pause] Okay, I'm not seeing a recent cleaning note on my screen for that spot. I can't tell you an exact date from here, but I'll ask the crew supervisor to check the records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So nobody know when they come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not from what I'm looking at, no. I'll flag it so somebody pulls the history."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I pay my taxes, every year. The drain, it is the city drain. I think somebody should come look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:22:47-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, understood, and that's fair. I'm putting in a request for a crew to inspect and clear it. They're pretty stacked after the storm, so I can't promise the hour, but it's going in as water heading to a garage, which helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you repeat, please? What you put in the paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. One seventy-two Harrison Avenue, storm drain in front not draining, water into the cellar a few inches, water running toward the neighbor's garage, and a question on when it was last cleaned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when the crew's been out? What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-six. And it's Mr. Hazard, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Alan Hazard. H-A-Z-A-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Now, for the water that's in your cellar, that's a little outside what I handle here. If you want to talk about damage, you could reach the city's other offices, I can transfer you to the main line, and they can point you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, please. What is the number? Extension?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll just transfer you, hang on. If it drops, the extension is two-one-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two hundred fourteen. Okay. Is that a street? Two-fourteen, which street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not a street, just an extension. Two-one-four, you dial it after the main line picks up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, extension. Okay, sorry. My ears, the phone is not good here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, the line's rough. Okay, so the drain request is in. Anything else on the drain itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:25:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Only please, somebody come soon. Before the next rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:25:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. Thanks for calling, Mr. Hazard. Stay dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
